@startuml series_state
title A stored series across runs
[*] --> Empty
Empty --> RawSeries : collector first fill, basis raw, from universe start, capped by end
Empty --> PreAdjusted : crypto, binance or CSV first fill, basis split_adjusted
RawSeries --> RawSeries : tail refresh reconciles newest-wins inside the newest tail sessions
RawSeries --> RawSeries : split synced later, whole series re-derived from raw
RawSeries --> Pinned : stored rows reach past a declared end
Pinned --> Pinned : inverted window, nothing fetched, leg green
PreAdjusted --> PreAdjusted : tail refresh reconciles, no split pass ever
PreAdjusted --> PreAdjusted : CSV import overwrites the whole series
PreAdjusted --> Refused : adjust command applied
Refused --> PreAdjusted : AdjustmentRefused raised, series unchanged
note right of RawSeries
  rows outside the tail stay frozen-first-seen only because they are not requested
  (JDL-066); unchanged re-serves write nothing (JDL-068)
end note
footer owner: data-load — realises JDL-063, JDL-064, JDL-065, JDL-066, JDL-068, JDL-069, JDL-070, JDL-093, JDL-094, JDL-095, JDL-049, JDL-051, JDL-096, JDL-100
@enduml
